Open System Interconnection

7. Application Layer - Provide network service directly to user application ex-web browsers
6. Presentation Layer - Translates, encrypts and compresses data | ex: excryprion/decryption
5. Session layer - establishes manages and terminates communication sessions | ex: session creation/maintainance
4. Transport Layer - Ensures reliable and fast delivery of the data | ex: end-to-end communication
3. network layer - determines the best path for data to travel | ex: IP addresses
2. data link layer - handles communication of devices on the same network | ex: MAC Adresses
1. Physical Layer - transmits raw bits over physical media | ex: fiber optic signals or wifi

